    "markdown": "pandas.DatetimeIndex.day# property DatetimeIndex.day[source]# The day of the datetime. Examples >>> datetime_series = pd.Series( ... pd.date_range(\"2000-01-01\", periods=3, freq=\"D\") ... ) >>> datetime_series 0 2000-01-01 1 2000-01-02 2 2000-01-03 dtype: datetime64[ns] >>> datetime_series.dt.day 0 1 1 2 2 3 dtype: int32",
